---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const productName = "Big Brain Ape The MemeCoin Sniper";
const botName = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_BOT_NAME ?? "Big Brain Ape";
const minFund = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_MIN_FUND_USD ?? "100";
const botLink = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_TELEGRAM_BOT_URL ?? "https://t.me/Big_Brain_Ape_Bot";
---
<BaseLayout title={`Docs — ${productName}`} description={`How to use ${productName}.`}>
  <div class="docs-layout">
    <aside class="docs-nav">
      <a href="#overview">Overview</a>
      <a href="#troop">The troop</a>
      <a href="#howto">How to start</a>
      <a href="#networks">Networks</a>
      <a href="#wallet">Wallet &amp; keys</a>
      <a href="#activate">Activate</a>
      <a href="#phase2">What comes next</a>
      <a href="#fees">Fees</a>
      <a href="#risks">Risks</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </aside>

    <article class="prose">
      <img
        class="docs-avatar"
        src="/mascot-cutout.jpg"
        alt={`${botName} mark`}
        width="72"
        height="72"
      />
      <h1>Docs</h1>
      <p>
        {productName} is a Telegram-native memecoin desk. Phase 1 covers wallet, funding, and activate.
        Automated snipes with dynamic stop-loss and trailing take-profit arrive in Phase 2.
      </p>

      <h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
      <p>
        There is no separate signup. Your Telegram account is your identity. The bot generates
        deposit addresses, tracks portfolio value, and unlocks Activate at ${minFund} USD.
        You talk to one bot — the head ape — who assigns five specialists when the engine is live.
      </p>

      <h2 id="troop">The troop</h2>
      <p>One chat. The boss plus five specialists:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Sniper</strong> — launches and fresh liquidity</li>
        <li><strong>Scout</strong> — smart money, KOL flow, narrative</li>
        <li><strong>Guard</strong> — rug screens and emergency exits</li>
        <li><strong>Arbiter</strong> — cross-chain spreads</li>
        <li><strong>Router</strong> — best fill across DEXes</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="howto">How to start</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Open <a href={botLink}>@Big_Brain_Ape_Bot</a> and tap <strong>Start</strong>.</li>
        <li>Tap <strong>Generate New Wallet</strong>.</li>
        <li>Copy your EVM and SOL addresses (or use Deposit).</li>
        <li>Send funds until Total ≥ ${minFund}.</li>
        <li>Tap <strong>Activate Bot</strong>.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 id="networks">Supported funding networks</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Base</strong> — ETH</li>
        <li><strong>Ethereum</strong> — ETH</li>
        <li><strong>Binance</strong> — BNB</li>
        <li><strong>Monad</strong> — MON</li>
        <li><strong>Robinhood</strong> — ETH</li>
        <li><strong>Solana</strong> — SOL</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        The five EVM networks share one address. Solana has a separate address. Only send the
        matching asset on the matching network.
      </p>

      <h2 id="wallet">Wallet &amp; keys</h2>
      <p>
        Keys are generated for you and stored encrypted on the server. Use
        <strong>Export Private Key</strong> to back them up. Anyone with the keys controls the funds.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Import a Wallet</strong> and <strong>Transfer</strong> are stubbed in Phase 1 and
        will be completed before public launch of trading.
      </p>

      <h2 id="activate">Activate</h2>
      <p>
        When portfolio USD value reaches ${minFund}, Activate becomes available. Phase 1 marks your
        agent as armed. No live trades execute until Phase 2.
      </p>

      <h2 id="phase2">What comes next</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Sniper / Scout / Guard / Arbiter / Router assignment on each opportunity</li>
        <li>Memecoin opportunity detection on selected DEXes</li>
        <li>Automatic entries from your funded wallet</li>
        <li>Dynamic stop-loss and trailing take-profit</li>
        <li>Telegram notifications on fills</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="fees">Fees</h2>
      <p>
        Planned fee: 2% of profit on closed wins only. Launch messaging includes a new-user promo
        window (default 48 hours, 0% fees). Exact schedule publishes before Phase 2 trading goes live.
      </p>

      <h2 id="risks">Risks</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Memecoins can go to zero quickly.</li>
        <li>Smart contract, RPC, and bot bugs can cause loss of funds.</li>
        <li>Server-held encrypted keys are a custody risk — export and self-custody if unsure.</li>
        <li>Past marketing claims are not guarantees of profit.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="faq">FAQ</h2>
      <p><strong>Do I need an exchange API key?</strong><br />No.</p>
      <p><strong>Is there a subscription?</strong><br />No subscription in the planned model.</p>
      <p><strong>Can I withdraw?</strong><br />Yes — Transfer ships fully in Phase 2; you can also export keys and move funds yourself.</p>
      <p><strong>Where is the Telegram bot?</strong><br /><a href={botLink}>@Big_Brain_Ape_Bot</a></p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
